From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_hnat: harden PPD/WED WWAN offload and NETSYS v3 HQoS

Preserve PPD bridge FDB mark and DT MAC classification, enable MT7987
WED<->EXT WWAN offload, serialize QDMA queue window access, honor mtk-qos
TCP ACK priority, skip non-ARP PDMA output from auto-PPPQ, skip marked
external RX exceptions, recover NETSYS v3 HQoS PPE_BYPASS external RX,
and relax ext-to-ge linearization.

Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
